omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vlVS1-FEhmMQ7kNvwGDFmz9&_nc_oc=AdrJncOSbchyfsxF4XJBa7U0WRl4OPCBJCVqJBFkyJQI2OdlpUVHh0aMvoDDsH7ruQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLiKWs0PtN1aCTEFcbb2Z4KAmzrNA89q8FrVl_uzP2CvA&oe=6ABA8634"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wcat-7S9n5wQ7kNvwGVqfhA&_nc_oc=Adr62wSauO43WyohYzUyz9ZBeJkMYbgMHwHbIt1Px_yQvKhblRT5JeYjxIR65IQovRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKrzCL99-8o-RiPYW9UPxgCcXG8E0j5bLHyOYzD6kNtbA&oe=6ABA8796"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=412RhifQWG4Q7kNvwFiyoVI&_nc_oc=AdooXvGBSZtFiAP4emkegHv5eZE-Xt0xdmRglphQzNtUDTne3HoweTsfbL1CgDAE3PI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJUk03ymFwPxVMQYBkqzHnUd36w-WqEerjHjzMcwcLYlQ&oe=6ABA6477"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://